1
00:00:12,530 --> 00:00:20,580
♪From primal chaos to the starry sky♪

2
00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:28,340
♪In the whole world, we hold balance♪

3
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:46,940
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

4
00:00:46,940 --> 00:00:50,810
♪The furnace refines the empty void♪

5
00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:54,930
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

6
00:00:54,930 --> 00:00:58,720
♪Split primal chaos wide open♪

7
00:01:36,380 --> 00:01:37,620
[Pull Strings]

8
00:01:37,620 --> 00:01:39,380
[Adapted from the novel
by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

9
00:01:43,920 --> 00:01:44,900
Darn it.

10
00:01:45,310 --> 00:01:47,100
Were it not that I cannot show my face,

11
00:01:47,640 --> 00:01:49,660
how could you guys match me?

12
00:01:51,430 --> 00:01:52,020
Who's there?

13
00:01:55,560 --> 00:01:56,540
Fairy Yunxiao.

14
00:02:03,200 --> 00:02:03,980
Father.

15
00:02:04,280 --> 00:02:05,490
An assassin was found in Dragon Palace.

16
00:02:05,510 --> 00:02:06,900
Someone really sneaked in here.

17
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:08,890
The assassin failed
to hurt Little Prince.

18
00:02:08,910 --> 00:02:10,820
Many guards saw him.

19
00:02:10,840 --> 00:02:11,820
This matter can't be fake.

20
00:02:11,840 --> 00:02:13,820
Since Junior Ling'e spoke the truth,

21
00:02:13,870 --> 00:02:15,780
then she didn't
break the glazed lantern.

22
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:17,610
Please have mercy.

23
00:02:22,910 --> 00:02:24,290
We caught her just this morning.

24
00:02:24,310 --> 00:02:26,260
And an assassin appears out of nowhere?

25
00:02:26,310 --> 00:02:27,340
What a coincidence.

26
00:02:27,520 --> 00:02:28,290
So coincidental.

27
00:02:28,710 --> 00:02:29,500
So coincidental.

28
00:02:31,030 --> 00:02:33,850
Tomorrow, my son weds.

29
00:02:33,870 --> 00:02:34,660
Turtle Minister.

30
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:37,220
Order tighter security.

31
00:02:37,240 --> 00:02:39,500
Tomorrow, we can't let the assassin

32
00:02:39,520 --> 00:02:40,610
ruin my son's wedding.

33
00:02:41,120 --> 00:02:41,610
Yes.

34
00:02:42,680 --> 00:02:43,290
Father.

35
00:02:43,470 --> 00:02:45,690
Then, about Ling'e...

36
00:02:49,800 --> 00:02:51,100
I'm naturally willing to let her go.

37
00:02:51,400 --> 00:02:52,610
The question is whether she wants

38
00:02:52,630 --> 00:02:54,130
to leave on her own.

39
00:02:54,240 --> 00:02:55,690
What does that mean?

40
00:02:59,680 --> 00:03:00,450
Ling'e.

41
00:03:01,280 --> 00:03:02,130
Are you all right?

42
00:03:04,910 --> 00:03:05,690
I'm fine.

43
00:03:06,630 --> 00:03:07,540
Junior Ling'e.

44
00:03:07,590 --> 00:03:08,850
The culprit you chased last night

45
00:03:08,870 --> 00:03:09,610
has been found.

46
00:03:09,630 --> 00:03:10,780
Your suspicion is cleared.

47
00:03:11,150 --> 00:03:11,850
Come home with us.

48
00:03:12,120 --> 00:03:13,500
Yeah, come back with us.

49
00:03:15,310 --> 00:03:16,100
Young lady.

50
00:03:17,840 --> 00:03:19,850
Do you wish to know who your father is?

51
00:03:20,520 --> 00:03:21,890
I never thought

52
00:03:22,310 --> 00:03:24,060
I still had family in this world.

53
00:03:25,240 --> 00:03:27,220
Please, tell me who my father is.

54
00:03:27,240 --> 00:03:28,660
Even if his identity

55
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:30,450
brings you great pain?

56
00:03:30,520 --> 00:03:32,540
No matter what, he's still my father.

57
00:03:32,710 --> 00:03:34,500
Even if I could just see him once.

58
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:36,850
I just wanna see what he looks like.

59
00:03:36,870 --> 00:03:37,380
Your Majesty.

60
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:39,820
Someone from the Ascendance Sect
seeks an audience.

61
00:03:40,560 --> 00:03:41,340
Good.

62
00:03:41,590 --> 00:03:43,380
If you want to know who your father is,

63
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:44,850
stay in prison today.

64
00:03:44,870 --> 00:03:46,500
Don't go back to your Senior.

65
00:03:46,520 --> 00:03:47,820
Tomorrow during the wedding,

66
00:03:47,840 --> 00:03:49,660
I'll tell you everything.

67
00:03:49,680 --> 00:03:50,410
Why?

68
00:03:50,590 --> 00:03:51,340
The people of Ascendance Sect

69
00:03:51,360 --> 00:03:53,170
probably already know your identity.

70
00:03:53,190 --> 00:03:54,610
Their care for you over the years

71
00:03:54,630 --> 00:03:56,100
was all an illusion.

72
00:03:59,870 --> 00:04:01,450
Was that mysterious person caught?

73
00:04:01,470 --> 00:04:04,260
Identity unknown. Whereabouts unclear.

74
00:04:04,800 --> 00:04:05,610
Meaning,

75
00:04:05,630 --> 00:04:07,130
my suspicion isn't fully cleared yet.

76
00:04:07,470 --> 00:04:10,100
Dragon Palace can't let me walk free.

77
00:04:12,840 --> 00:04:14,380
Once things are clear after the wedding,

78
00:04:14,710 --> 00:04:16,050
come pick me up then.

79
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:17,780
Junior.

80
00:04:21,270 --> 00:04:22,140
Are you alright?

81
00:04:24,630 --> 00:04:25,410
I'm fine.

82
00:04:25,720 --> 00:04:27,810
The Dragon King treats me well.

83
00:04:27,830 --> 00:04:29,050
Senior, you needn't worry.

84
00:04:29,720 --> 00:04:30,490
Good.

85
00:04:30,630 --> 00:04:31,410
Off you go then.

86
00:04:35,070 --> 00:04:36,610
Tomorrow is my son's wedding.

87
00:04:36,920 --> 00:04:39,220
Enjoy the feast and have fun.

88
00:04:46,460 --> 00:04:49,300
[Episode 25]

89
00:04:53,390 --> 00:04:55,050
This outfit is stunning.

90
00:04:55,070 --> 00:04:55,580
Indeed.

91
00:04:55,830 --> 00:04:56,810
On this joyous day,

92
00:04:56,830 --> 00:04:58,810
he must look his finest.

93
00:04:58,870 --> 00:05:00,290
Let's check everything once more.

94
00:05:00,310 --> 00:05:01,290
We can't afford any mistakes.

95
00:05:01,310 --> 00:05:01,850
Okay.

96
00:05:07,480 --> 00:05:09,170
East Sea is so great.

97
00:05:09,190 --> 00:05:10,700
We love the East Sea.

98
00:05:11,720 --> 00:05:13,220
Working is so happy.

99
00:05:13,240 --> 00:05:14,340
- So happy.
- Yes.

100
00:05:19,630 --> 00:05:20,730
The Sea Deity Sect rules.

101
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:23,140
The Sea Deity Sect rules.

102
00:05:23,240 --> 00:05:24,490
Right, we're all its followers.

103
00:05:38,630 --> 00:05:40,930
When can I get married?

104
00:05:42,180 --> 00:05:44,420
[Happiness]

105
00:05:46,630 --> 00:05:47,580
Put this over there.

106
00:05:55,430 --> 00:05:56,700
In a bit, let's run through it again.

107
00:05:59,540 --> 00:06:02,340
[Happiness]

108
00:06:19,310 --> 00:06:22,290
Since last night, Bian Zhuang vanished.

109
00:06:22,310 --> 00:06:23,460
Aren't you going to find him?

110
00:06:24,240 --> 00:06:26,220
Lord Bian has his mission.

111
00:06:27,600 --> 00:06:29,250
Why bother worrying?

112
00:06:31,510 --> 00:06:33,290
After Ao Yi's wedding today,

113
00:06:33,830 --> 00:06:36,700
your decades of plans in East Sea

114
00:06:37,120 --> 00:06:38,660
will go down the drain.

115
00:06:39,120 --> 00:06:40,410
Does that not concern you?

116
00:06:41,310 --> 00:06:42,700
How do you know

117
00:06:44,070 --> 00:06:46,290
no surprise will happen today?

118
00:06:51,270 --> 00:06:52,900
What plan do you have

119
00:06:53,430 --> 00:06:54,900
to be so calm?

120
00:06:56,430 --> 00:06:57,370
Today

121
00:06:58,310 --> 00:07:00,140
is a big day.

122
00:07:22,100 --> 00:07:24,780
[Happiness]

123
00:07:40,270 --> 00:07:41,580
Keep the music playing.

124
00:07:41,600 --> 00:07:42,410
Don't let the mood drop.

125
00:07:46,430 --> 00:07:47,220
Aunt.

126
00:07:49,040 --> 00:07:50,900
Didn't you quit drinking?

127
00:07:51,270 --> 00:07:53,100
Just sniffing it. What's up?

128
00:07:54,120 --> 00:07:54,900
Look.

129
00:07:57,120 --> 00:08:00,100
What is Changshou planning to do?

130
00:08:00,120 --> 00:08:02,660
Senior always plays it safe.
He has his plans.

131
00:08:02,680 --> 00:08:04,020
Then why ask me?

132
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:06,340
Where's Fairy Yunxiao?

133
00:08:07,950 --> 00:08:08,730
Changshou.

134
00:08:09,600 --> 00:08:10,370
Changshou.

135
00:08:11,310 --> 00:08:12,900
The Dragon King's too much.

136
00:08:13,600 --> 00:08:15,460
He's late for his son's wedding.

137
00:08:16,240 --> 00:08:17,020
Yes.

138
00:08:17,510 --> 00:08:18,490
Probably

139
00:08:18,720 --> 00:08:19,900
stuck in traffic?

140
00:08:21,830 --> 00:08:23,340
Stuck in traffic underwater?

141
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:24,900
Nonsense.

142
00:08:25,560 --> 00:08:26,370
Yeah.

143
00:08:43,120 --> 00:08:43,890
Your Majesty.

144
00:08:44,870 --> 00:08:45,980
You sent for me?

145
00:08:48,910 --> 00:08:50,250
Why are you standing?

146
00:08:50,270 --> 00:08:51,220
Come, sit.

147
00:08:51,390 --> 00:08:52,060
No.

148
00:08:52,440 --> 00:08:53,220
Sit.

149
00:08:56,320 --> 00:08:58,100
Then I shall be so bold.

150
00:09:03,910 --> 00:09:04,700
Turtle.

151
00:09:07,030 --> 00:09:09,530
How many years have you served me?

152
00:09:10,630 --> 00:09:11,420
Well...

153
00:09:12,960 --> 00:09:14,370
A thousand years.

154
00:09:15,080 --> 00:09:16,300
A thousand years?

155
00:09:18,030 --> 00:09:19,060
Yes.

156
00:09:19,120 --> 00:09:21,300
I recall you were a little turtle then.

157
00:09:21,320 --> 00:09:21,890
Yes.

158
00:09:22,510 --> 00:09:24,300
So cute back then.

159
00:09:28,320 --> 00:09:30,100
It has not been easy.

160
00:09:31,320 --> 00:09:32,490
In another thousand years,

161
00:09:32,910 --> 00:09:35,530
I still wish to serve Your Majesty.

162
00:09:36,240 --> 00:09:38,100
For Your Majesty,

163
00:09:38,120 --> 00:09:39,580
and for the Dragon Palace
of the East Sea,

164
00:09:39,720 --> 00:09:41,700
dying would be no regret.

165
00:09:44,790 --> 00:09:46,490
I know your loyalty.

166
00:09:46,510 --> 00:09:47,130
Yes.

167
00:09:50,870 --> 00:09:51,700
Turtle.

168
00:09:53,200 --> 00:09:56,340
If one day I do something wrong,

169
00:09:57,270 --> 00:09:58,490
what would you think?

170
00:09:59,720 --> 00:10:00,490
Well...

171
00:10:01,510 --> 00:10:02,890
If I should ever do something

172
00:10:04,670 --> 00:10:07,490
that harms the Dragon Palace,

173
00:10:07,840 --> 00:10:09,700
would you still stand with me?

174
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:12,100
How could Your Majesty do wrong?

175
00:10:12,120 --> 00:10:13,370
Whatever Your Majesty does

176
00:10:13,390 --> 00:10:15,300
must be far-sighted,

177
00:10:15,320 --> 00:10:17,610
mysterious, and proper.

178
00:10:17,630 --> 00:10:18,850
Enough, enough.

179
00:10:19,600 --> 00:10:21,490
No need to flatter me today.

180
00:10:24,120 --> 00:10:25,700
Go bring that girl here.

181
00:10:27,120 --> 00:10:27,890
Yes.

182
00:10:51,600 --> 00:10:52,370
Young lady.

183
00:10:52,440 --> 00:10:53,610
His Majesty summons you.

184
00:11:00,510 --> 00:11:02,610
Your Majesty, she is here.

185
00:11:03,870 --> 00:11:04,890
Greetings, Your Majesty.

186
00:11:06,200 --> 00:11:06,940
Young lady.

187
00:11:07,670 --> 00:11:08,700
Come with me.

188
00:11:09,150 --> 00:11:09,940
What?

189
00:11:10,790 --> 00:11:11,580
Go on.

190
00:11:17,670 --> 00:11:18,700
You will not be needed.

191
00:11:18,720 --> 00:11:19,820
Your Majesty, but...

192
00:11:19,840 --> 00:11:22,130
Rest easy. I know what I'm doing.

193
00:11:22,270 --> 00:11:24,730
The path ahead is not for you.

194
00:11:25,320 --> 00:11:26,940
Young lady, let's go.

195
00:11:40,670 --> 00:11:41,700
Aunt. Junior.

196
00:11:42,270 --> 00:11:43,100
Cover me.

197
00:11:48,630 --> 00:11:49,420
Your Majesty.

198
00:11:49,720 --> 00:11:51,100
Where are you taking me?

199
00:11:51,120 --> 00:11:54,100
To a place you once lived.

200
00:11:55,670 --> 00:11:57,460
But this isn't heading to guest rooms.

201
00:11:58,630 --> 00:11:59,650
Not a guest room.

202
00:12:00,200 --> 00:12:03,100
It's where you lived in as an infant.

203
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:15,890
Where are we?

204
00:12:18,550 --> 00:12:19,980
Shh.

205
00:12:21,510 --> 00:12:22,420
Don't speak.

206
00:12:24,320 --> 00:12:26,890
Feel the spiritual power here.

207
00:12:39,910 --> 00:12:40,700
What is this?

208
00:12:41,320 --> 00:12:45,250
Your father's spiritual power
lingers here.

209
00:12:45,840 --> 00:12:47,370
It gathered in this very place.

210
00:12:47,790 --> 00:12:50,700
A thousand years, and it won't fade.

211
00:12:54,600 --> 00:12:55,370
My father?

212
00:12:56,240 --> 00:12:57,010
Yes.

213
00:12:57,790 --> 00:12:59,730
Don't you want to see him?

214
00:13:00,510 --> 00:13:02,250
I can take you to see him right now.

215
00:13:03,480 --> 00:13:04,850
You can take me to see him?

216
00:13:05,870 --> 00:13:06,850
I said before,

217
00:13:07,510 --> 00:13:10,490
the Chaos Bell can bend time itself.

218
00:13:11,240 --> 00:13:12,250
Just that

219
00:13:12,480 --> 00:13:14,300
your spiritual power is too weak now.

220
00:13:14,510 --> 00:13:16,420
Only able to trace back a moment.

221
00:13:16,440 --> 00:13:17,130
But,

222
00:13:17,910 --> 00:13:19,890
your father's spiritual energy is here.

223
00:13:20,320 --> 00:13:22,700
He's no ordinary mortal like us.

224
00:13:22,910 --> 00:13:26,130
As long as you comprehend carefully,

225
00:13:26,510 --> 00:13:28,980
you'll trace back a thousand years soon.

226
00:13:29,000 --> 00:13:30,010
At that time,

227
00:13:30,440 --> 00:13:32,700
you can meet your father.

228
00:13:33,200 --> 00:13:34,490
Tracing back a thousand years?

229
00:13:39,240 --> 00:13:40,610
If I go back that far,

230
00:13:41,670 --> 00:13:42,890
did Ascendance Sect exist?

231
00:13:43,000 --> 00:13:44,100
Ascendance Sect?

232
00:13:44,720 --> 00:13:46,890
There was no such sect back then.

233
00:13:46,910 --> 00:13:49,100
But my Senior, Mentor, and Aunt...

234
00:13:49,120 --> 00:13:51,420
They're hardly worth mentioning.

235
00:13:53,840 --> 00:13:56,100
Then all my days at Jade Division...

236
00:13:56,720 --> 00:13:57,490
Could it be...

237
00:14:04,510 --> 00:14:06,250
Do you know how long I saved it?

238
00:14:06,270 --> 00:14:07,460
Mentor, strong drink cuts deep.

239
00:14:07,480 --> 00:14:08,100
No more drinking.

240
00:14:14,510 --> 00:14:15,820
Mother, Brother.

241
00:14:16,320 --> 00:14:17,850
I have reached my new home.

242
00:14:20,840 --> 00:14:21,850
I have made up my mind.

243
00:14:24,480 --> 00:14:25,490
I am not going back.

244
00:14:26,120 --> 00:14:27,730
Did you not wish to see your father?

245
00:14:28,720 --> 00:14:30,220
Go back a thousand years,

246
00:14:30,440 --> 00:14:32,250
and he will be waiting there.

247
00:14:32,270 --> 00:14:33,890
But I already have a home.

248
00:14:35,120 --> 00:14:37,420
[Jade Division]
Though it's poor and shabby,

249
00:14:37,720 --> 00:14:38,890
that's my home.

250
00:14:40,120 --> 00:14:41,490
I also have family now.

251
00:14:42,510 --> 00:14:44,060
Pity that as their Mentor,

252
00:14:44,270 --> 00:14:45,730
I have no achievements.

253
00:14:45,790 --> 00:14:48,490
For these two kids,
if Tribulation befalls them,

254
00:14:48,510 --> 00:14:49,850
may I ask you

255
00:14:52,120 --> 00:14:53,130
to help them out?

256
00:14:54,200 --> 00:14:55,890
A rather weak Mentor

257
00:14:56,480 --> 00:14:58,250
and a very annoying Senior.

258
00:14:58,910 --> 00:15:00,300
Still, they are my family.

259
00:15:02,040 --> 00:15:06,720
♪An edge hides, yet flows with ease♪

260
00:15:07,400 --> 00:15:13,930
♪Making me lean down and confirm slowly♪

261
00:15:15,270 --> 00:15:16,890
Even if this home falls short,

262
00:15:18,510 --> 00:15:20,220
I live very happily.

263
00:15:20,860 --> 00:15:23,870
♪Day after day, with whom to share♪

264
00:15:23,870 --> 00:15:24,730
I believe

265
00:15:25,840 --> 00:15:27,850
my parents, even a thousand years ago,

266
00:15:30,200 --> 00:15:31,700
would be happy

267
00:15:35,030 --> 00:15:36,490
to see me living happily today.

268
00:15:38,440 --> 00:15:39,220
Young lady.

269
00:15:40,670 --> 00:15:42,010
Your words

270
00:15:42,550 --> 00:15:45,220
put me in a tough spot.

271
00:15:47,200 --> 00:15:48,130
Thank you, Your Majesty.

272
00:15:49,080 --> 00:15:50,300
I should leave now.

273
00:15:55,510 --> 00:15:56,300
You...

274
00:16:06,870 --> 00:16:08,940
Did you think

275
00:16:09,200 --> 00:16:10,580
I brought you to see your father?

276
00:16:11,320 --> 00:16:12,890
I'm making a wager

277
00:16:12,910 --> 00:16:14,100
with someone mysterious.

278
00:16:14,440 --> 00:16:16,250
If I win, all is well.

279
00:16:16,750 --> 00:16:18,370
If I lose,

280
00:16:19,670 --> 00:16:21,100
that Chaos Bell of yours

281
00:16:21,270 --> 00:16:23,460
is my only way out.

282
00:16:23,720 --> 00:16:24,730
So,

283
00:16:25,360 --> 00:16:26,610
you cannot go anywhere.

284
00:16:28,480 --> 00:16:29,490
Scripture of Steadiness says,

285
00:16:29,670 --> 00:16:31,460
"When things look bad, flee fast."

286
00:16:38,870 --> 00:16:39,460
You...

287
00:16:39,790 --> 00:16:40,580
Young lady.

288
00:16:40,870 --> 00:16:43,890
Do you know
of the ancient Deity-Demon War?

289
00:16:49,870 --> 00:16:52,730
Aren't you curious?

290
00:16:52,910 --> 00:16:54,820
Why did our Dragon Clan

291
00:16:55,200 --> 00:16:57,850
earn great merit in that war

292
00:16:57,870 --> 00:16:59,890
and get to share the realm with humans?

293
00:17:00,630 --> 00:17:01,530
Look.

294
00:17:02,200 --> 00:17:03,940
Do I look human to you?

295
00:17:05,310 --> 00:17:06,090
No.

296
00:17:06,480 --> 00:17:07,290
Then,

297
00:17:08,750 --> 00:17:09,940
do I look like a demon?

298
00:17:11,400 --> 00:17:12,180
A little bit.

299
00:17:12,200 --> 00:17:12,980
A little?

300
00:17:13,240 --> 00:17:14,490
No, not at all.

301
00:17:14,510 --> 00:17:15,180
Wrong.

302
00:17:15,440 --> 00:17:17,420
Far more than that.

303
00:17:18,480 --> 00:17:21,250
I am a demon.

304
00:17:22,000 --> 00:17:23,290
To the Human Clan,

305
00:17:23,510 --> 00:17:26,290
I am both savior and enemy.

306
00:17:26,720 --> 00:17:28,220
To the Dragon Clan,

307
00:17:28,240 --> 00:17:30,860
humans feel both gratitude and fear.

308
00:17:30,920 --> 00:17:34,010
They drove us beyond the Four Seas,

309
00:17:34,030 --> 00:17:35,220
far from the Mortal Realm.

310
00:17:35,240 --> 00:17:36,250
And they dressed it up,

311
00:17:36,270 --> 00:17:38,700
calling me King of the Four Seas.

312
00:17:38,790 --> 00:17:40,050
How absurd.

313
00:17:40,720 --> 00:17:42,860
The truth is, they had me

314
00:17:43,590 --> 00:17:45,290
guard that ancient demon for them.

315
00:17:45,310 --> 00:17:47,900
It's so terrifying that even
thinking about it scares me.

316
00:17:48,070 --> 00:17:49,810
It's been sealed
beneath the Eye of the Sea

317
00:17:49,830 --> 00:17:54,050
for a thousand years,
and it still won't stay quiet.

318
00:17:57,400 --> 00:17:59,140
What has that to do with me?

319
00:18:00,270 --> 00:18:01,810
Everything.

320
00:18:02,880 --> 00:18:04,460
Everything.

321
00:18:05,030 --> 00:18:05,810
Because...

322
00:18:07,920 --> 00:18:09,660
Transposition. Go.

323
00:18:10,640 --> 00:18:12,250
Because your father...

324
00:18:12,310 --> 00:18:12,730
He...

325
00:18:24,920 --> 00:18:26,420
Copy the scripture 500 times?

326
00:18:26,420 --> 00:18:28,100
[Copy the Scripture 500 Times]

327
00:18:34,640 --> 00:18:35,660
Senior.

328
00:18:38,310 --> 00:18:39,250
Why is it you?

329
00:18:39,270 --> 00:18:41,530
I sensed Your Majesty missed me.

330
00:18:42,510 --> 00:18:44,050
The Swap Talisman?

331
00:18:45,480 --> 00:18:46,250
Junior.

332
00:18:50,310 --> 00:18:51,620
No wonder you're the Dragon King.

333
00:18:51,640 --> 00:18:53,700
You even know human spells so well.

334
00:18:53,720 --> 00:18:54,460
Impressive.

335
00:18:54,920 --> 00:18:57,810
So you are the mastermind

336
00:18:57,830 --> 00:18:59,900
behind the succession battle.

337
00:19:00,310 --> 00:19:01,090
No, no.

338
00:19:01,110 --> 00:19:02,250
Can't call me a mastermind.

339
00:19:02,270 --> 00:19:02,730
I am merely

340
00:19:02,750 --> 00:19:04,940
a human disciple playing it safe.

341
00:19:05,400 --> 00:19:06,810
You're too arrogant.

342
00:19:06,830 --> 00:19:08,490
Since you fell into my hands,

343
00:19:08,680 --> 00:19:10,460
I definitely won't spare you today.

344
00:19:10,480 --> 00:19:11,250
Because

345
00:19:11,400 --> 00:19:12,940
you're too dangerous.

346
00:19:16,270 --> 00:19:17,290
Celestial Court weapons?

347
00:19:17,350 --> 00:19:17,980
Who's there?

348
00:19:18,610 --> 00:19:20,700
♪Now, a levee holds back the storm♪

349
00:19:21,010 --> 00:19:24,020
♪Fight against fate for my life♪

350
00:19:24,020 --> 00:19:26,840
♪Close eyes to sense the world♪

351
00:19:26,840 --> 00:19:29,260
♪Years splash ink♪

352
00:19:29,440 --> 00:19:30,900
Fairy Yunxiao?

353
00:19:33,200 --> 00:19:34,900
Your watch over Yunxiao

354
00:19:34,920 --> 00:19:36,460
truly never stops.

355
00:19:36,480 --> 00:19:39,010
It kept her from opening up to me,

356
00:19:39,240 --> 00:19:40,530
nearly causing a misunderstanding.

357
00:19:43,510 --> 00:19:44,290
Yunxiao.

358
00:19:44,790 --> 00:19:45,700
Who are you?

359
00:19:45,920 --> 00:19:46,900
Do I know you?

360
00:19:47,720 --> 00:19:49,940
A lowly human disciple like you,

361
00:19:50,070 --> 00:19:52,290
what brings you here so late at night?

362
00:19:52,310 --> 00:19:54,700
Fairy Yunxiao is naturally clever.

363
00:19:54,720 --> 00:19:55,570
She refusing to acknowledge me

364
00:19:55,590 --> 00:19:56,460
must have a reason.

365
00:19:56,480 --> 00:19:58,090
The clues aren't hard to read.

366
00:19:58,310 --> 00:20:00,140
She wants to hide from eyes and ears.

367
00:20:00,160 --> 00:20:01,980
If not for the Dragon Palace,

368
00:20:02,160 --> 00:20:03,730
I'd teach you a real lesson.

369
00:20:04,590 --> 00:20:06,220
Stop staring. Get out.

370
00:20:07,400 --> 00:20:08,460
Sorry to disturb you.

371
00:20:09,920 --> 00:20:10,940
You brat.

372
00:20:11,160 --> 00:20:13,090
You always rejected my help before.

373
00:20:13,310 --> 00:20:14,090
Today,

374
00:20:14,310 --> 00:20:16,200
I'll make sure you see my real skills.

375
00:20:17,520 --> 00:20:19,300
Yunxiao and I are in sync.

376
00:20:19,320 --> 00:20:20,260
From that moment on,

377
00:20:20,400 --> 00:20:22,660
no words were needed between us.

378
00:20:22,680 --> 00:20:24,050
Everything fell into place.

379
00:20:24,110 --> 00:20:26,500
Your Majesty took Junior Ling'e today.

380
00:20:26,520 --> 00:20:27,980
So you probably couldn't personally

381
00:20:28,000 --> 00:20:29,610
monitor Fairy Yunxiao's movements.

382
00:20:30,110 --> 00:20:31,140
I never thought

383
00:20:31,790 --> 00:20:33,530
one careless moment

384
00:20:33,550 --> 00:20:36,140
would lead to all this.

385
00:20:36,230 --> 00:20:37,210
Fairy Yunxiao,

386
00:20:37,840 --> 00:20:39,370
though you are a Quasi-Saint,

387
00:20:39,550 --> 00:20:40,980
and I may fall short of you,

388
00:20:41,160 --> 00:20:44,010
I'm still an Empyreal Aureate Immortal.

389
00:20:44,320 --> 00:20:46,100
If we really fight,

390
00:20:46,120 --> 00:20:48,050
even if I lose,

391
00:20:48,070 --> 00:20:51,420
you'd be badly drained too.

392
00:20:54,120 --> 00:20:55,020
Your Majesty,

393
00:20:55,350 --> 00:20:56,700
you never meant to strike.

394
00:20:56,720 --> 00:20:58,210
Why lose your temper now?

395
00:20:59,550 --> 00:21:00,700
How do you know?

396
00:21:04,670 --> 00:21:06,330
I don't wanna fight?

397
00:21:06,630 --> 00:21:08,890
A Quasi-Saint
against an Empyreal Aureate Immortal

398
00:21:08,910 --> 00:21:10,970
will take hours to settle.

399
00:21:11,120 --> 00:21:12,890
Besides, you set this trap

400
00:21:12,910 --> 00:21:15,100
to ruin the wedding.

401
00:21:15,120 --> 00:21:16,330
Now that the situation is set,

402
00:21:16,480 --> 00:21:18,570
why trouble yourself, Your Majesty?

403
00:21:21,120 --> 00:21:24,490
Looks like you already set the game

404
00:21:24,880 --> 00:21:27,020
to play with me.

405
00:21:29,480 --> 00:21:31,610
Fine. For many years,

406
00:21:31,630 --> 00:21:33,250
no one dared play against me.

407
00:21:33,320 --> 00:21:35,690
Today I'll play a game with you.

408
00:21:36,760 --> 00:21:38,380
When did you first find out

409
00:21:38,600 --> 00:21:40,100
I was the mastermind?

410
00:21:40,150 --> 00:21:42,660
I knew from the start.

411
00:21:43,040 --> 00:21:44,130
From the start?

412
00:21:45,760 --> 00:21:48,180
The Westdawn Sect used the Crown Prince,

413
00:21:48,200 --> 00:21:49,250
scheming for years.

414
00:21:50,240 --> 00:21:52,530
Yet the Crown Prince only held power,

415
00:21:52,550 --> 00:21:54,460
never claimed the throne.

416
00:21:55,880 --> 00:21:57,940
His wedding
with the Mermaid Princess failed too.

417
00:21:58,430 --> 00:22:01,220
Who kept blocking the Westdawn Sect?

418
00:22:02,710 --> 00:22:05,530
I'm just a senile old dragon.

419
00:22:05,760 --> 00:22:07,220
Aged and weak.

420
00:22:07,510 --> 00:22:08,860
How could I manage that?

421
00:22:08,880 --> 00:22:11,250
The weapons I used
were all Celestial Court treasures.

422
00:22:11,350 --> 00:22:13,220
Each is a demon-slaying artifact.

423
00:22:13,430 --> 00:22:15,820
Yet you blocked them all, unharmed.

424
00:22:16,240 --> 00:22:18,380
How can you say you're aged and weak?

425
00:22:18,400 --> 00:22:19,690
On this Dragon Palace trip,

426
00:22:19,710 --> 00:22:20,970
the biggest obstacle

427
00:22:21,040 --> 00:22:22,410
isn't the Westdawn Sect,

428
00:22:22,430 --> 00:22:23,690
but you, Your Majesty.

429
00:22:23,910 --> 00:22:25,890
Westdawn's fed
on the Dragon Palace for years.

430
00:22:25,910 --> 00:22:27,300
All with your consent.

431
00:22:27,510 --> 00:22:29,580
But why did you refuse to let them

432
00:22:29,600 --> 00:22:30,930
complete this final step?

433
00:22:31,110 --> 00:22:33,490
In my view, there is only one reason.

434
00:22:33,510 --> 00:22:35,090
You are waiting for the best offer.

435
00:22:36,320 --> 00:22:37,740
I'm a realistic dragon.

436
00:22:38,230 --> 00:22:40,490
Don't care about Celestial Court
or Three Sects.

437
00:22:40,510 --> 00:22:42,180
All I care about

438
00:22:42,320 --> 00:22:44,090
is who offers the most.

439
00:22:45,160 --> 00:22:46,890
So as long as the Dragon Palace
stays neutral,

440
00:22:47,040 --> 00:22:48,020
the Celestial Court and Westdawn

441
00:22:48,040 --> 00:22:49,610
will keep winning over the Dragon Clan.

442
00:22:50,110 --> 00:22:52,090
Your leverage will keep growing.

443
00:22:52,110 --> 00:22:53,490
Once pledging to one side,

444
00:22:53,790 --> 00:22:55,930
I'll lose the leverage to demand more

445
00:22:56,110 --> 00:22:58,580
and break completely with the other.

446
00:22:59,280 --> 00:23:00,610
The loss outweighs the gain.

447
00:23:01,440 --> 00:23:02,210
In the end,

448
00:23:02,510 --> 00:23:05,300
whether Ao Jia leads the dragons
to Westdawn,

449
00:23:05,320 --> 00:23:07,420
or Ao Yi to the Celestial Court,

450
00:23:07,440 --> 00:23:08,980
you will intervene.

451
00:23:09,070 --> 00:23:11,020
So from the very beginning, you knew

452
00:23:11,720 --> 00:23:12,770
your opponent

453
00:23:13,160 --> 00:23:13,980
was me.

454
00:23:14,480 --> 00:23:15,180
Your Majesty,

455
00:23:15,720 --> 00:23:16,860
this game is set.

456
00:23:16,880 --> 00:23:18,700
Black and white, evenly poised.

457
00:23:19,760 --> 00:23:20,300
Wrong.

458
00:23:20,670 --> 00:23:21,860
It's not equal.

459
00:23:22,280 --> 00:23:23,810
This is the East Sea.

460
00:23:24,070 --> 00:23:24,740
I have

461
00:23:25,390 --> 00:23:27,260
the first-move advantage.

462
00:23:28,510 --> 00:23:30,050
The advantage you spoke of,

463
00:23:32,720 --> 00:23:33,860
could it be Jin Chan?

464
00:23:35,110 --> 00:23:36,420
Your Majesty wants me

465
00:23:37,040 --> 00:23:38,980
to ruin the wedding in three days?

466
00:23:42,510 --> 00:23:45,180
Hear those magpies sing and cheer,

467
00:23:45,350 --> 00:23:47,810
our happy couple's finally here.

468
00:23:48,000 --> 00:23:50,140
Two are better than one,

469
00:23:50,160 --> 00:23:52,490
that's the way it goes.

470
00:23:52,510 --> 00:23:54,610
Now let's welcome our newlyweds.

471
00:23:55,200 --> 00:23:56,140
Music.

472
00:23:56,300 --> 00:24:01,540
[Happiness]

473
00:24:41,630 --> 00:24:44,690
I know you two can't wait.

474
00:24:44,880 --> 00:24:47,450
But all is ready,

475
00:24:47,680 --> 00:24:48,980
except your father.

476
00:24:49,510 --> 00:24:51,220
Let's see where the Dragon King is.

477
00:24:55,440 --> 00:24:56,780
What a perfect match.

478
00:24:56,880 --> 00:24:58,100
So adorable.

479
00:25:00,360 --> 00:25:02,010
That night in Lotus Hall,

480
00:25:02,800 --> 00:25:04,300
you wanted to see two people.

481
00:25:04,440 --> 00:25:05,130
One

482
00:25:05,470 --> 00:25:07,490
was Westdawn Sect's mole.

483
00:25:07,800 --> 00:25:09,010
You let him cause chaos

484
00:25:09,150 --> 00:25:10,690
to disrupt the Celestial Court's plan.

485
00:25:11,030 --> 00:25:11,900
Exactly.

486
00:25:12,560 --> 00:25:13,810
What about the other person?

487
00:25:13,950 --> 00:25:15,300
The other person

488
00:25:16,120 --> 00:25:17,220
would be me.

489
00:25:20,000 --> 00:25:21,610
The Celestial Court publicly presented

490
00:25:21,630 --> 00:25:23,610
the Pregenesis Sword fragment to you.

491
00:25:23,830 --> 00:25:24,930
Your Majesty saw through it.

492
00:25:24,950 --> 00:25:26,660
This was Celestial Court's baiting trap.

493
00:25:26,680 --> 00:25:28,130
If Westdawn dared to strike,

494
00:25:28,150 --> 00:25:30,100
the Celestial Court would
unleash fatal moves.

495
00:25:30,120 --> 00:25:31,300
After warning Westdawn,

496
00:25:31,440 --> 00:25:32,180
naturally you'd also warn me,

497
00:25:32,200 --> 00:25:34,300
the proxy sent by the Celestial Court.

498
00:25:34,360 --> 00:25:35,300
But you didn't

499
00:25:35,590 --> 00:25:37,490
show up that night.

500
00:25:38,510 --> 00:25:39,900
Your Majesty hid with power

501
00:25:40,150 --> 00:25:41,490
that even Jin Chan failed to notice,

502
00:25:41,510 --> 00:25:43,050
let alone a disciple like me.

503
00:25:43,200 --> 00:25:43,810
However,

504
00:25:44,120 --> 00:25:45,900
someone in the Dragon Palace

505
00:25:45,920 --> 00:25:47,540
is more powerful than you

506
00:25:47,880 --> 00:25:49,690
and can sense your presence.

507
00:25:51,440 --> 00:25:54,010
I must thank Fairy Yunxiao

508
00:25:54,030 --> 00:25:55,540
for knowing what I had in mind.

509
00:25:55,880 --> 00:25:57,300
Knowing my worth now, huh?

510
00:25:58,070 --> 00:25:59,100
Yes, I know.

511
00:26:01,030 --> 00:26:02,740
If you hadn't appeared that night,

512
00:26:03,120 --> 00:26:05,660
how did you learn of Jin Chan?

513
00:26:06,120 --> 00:26:07,100
Why couldn't I

514
00:26:07,270 --> 00:26:09,610
use his pawn for myself?

515
00:26:11,120 --> 00:26:12,100
Fairy Yunxiao.

516
00:26:12,120 --> 00:26:14,490
Didn't you say you'd work with me?

517
00:26:16,800 --> 00:26:17,810
Did I say that?

518
00:26:19,440 --> 00:26:20,490
You must be mistaken.

519
00:26:20,800 --> 00:26:21,570
Stop right there.

520
00:26:21,800 --> 00:26:23,420
When Lan Ling'e was captured,

521
00:26:23,510 --> 00:26:25,220
she said she saw a mysterious person.

522
00:26:25,240 --> 00:26:26,740
He was not from the Dragon Palace,

523
00:26:26,760 --> 00:26:28,100
nor among the people I brought.

524
00:26:28,240 --> 00:26:30,900
Then he must be from the Westdawn Sect.

525
00:26:31,030 --> 00:26:32,570
So you faked the assassination scare

526
00:26:32,590 --> 00:26:34,130
just to draw him out.

527
00:26:34,270 --> 00:26:36,050
That person is the Lord of Horizon Hall,

528
00:26:36,240 --> 00:26:37,570
named Bian Zhuang.

529
00:26:38,120 --> 00:26:39,130
Once upon a time,

530
00:26:39,510 --> 00:26:41,740
he was Westdawn's face in the South Sea.

531
00:26:41,880 --> 00:26:45,490
Did he inform you of Jin Chan's plot?

532
00:26:45,830 --> 00:26:46,570
But,

533
00:26:46,950 --> 00:26:48,930
from my knowledge of the Westdawn Sect,

534
00:26:48,950 --> 00:26:50,490
they are ruthless and cruel.

535
00:26:50,880 --> 00:26:52,490
What method did you use

536
00:26:52,510 --> 00:26:54,340
to make him obey you?

537
00:26:56,630 --> 00:26:57,570
Well...

538
00:26:58,270 --> 00:26:59,490
That's not difficult.

539
00:27:01,150 --> 00:27:02,810
I really can't.

540
00:27:02,830 --> 00:27:04,610
Moon Elder!

541
00:27:04,920 --> 00:27:06,370
It is no use.

542
00:27:06,390 --> 00:27:08,540
Just help me find my match.

543
00:27:08,560 --> 00:27:10,010
Whatever you want, I will give.

544
00:27:10,030 --> 00:27:11,660
Whatever you ask, I will agree to.

545
00:27:11,680 --> 00:27:13,250
I can't do it.

546
00:27:14,800 --> 00:27:16,490
Are you a pervert?

547
00:27:16,510 --> 00:27:17,130
I...

548
00:27:17,440 --> 00:27:19,810
What is love in this world?

549
00:27:21,270 --> 00:27:22,050
Slightly sour?

550
00:27:22,070 --> 00:27:22,780
Pervert.

551
00:27:22,800 --> 00:27:24,010
Catching him

552
00:27:24,030 --> 00:27:26,660
was thanks to Lan Ling'e delaying you,

553
00:27:26,680 --> 00:27:28,300
leaving Fairy Yunxiao unwatched.

554
00:27:28,320 --> 00:27:31,420
Even if he told you Jin Chan's plot,

555
00:27:31,440 --> 00:27:32,740
so what?

556
00:27:32,880 --> 00:27:34,860
From my years of knowing Jin Chan,

557
00:27:34,880 --> 00:27:35,860
his methods

558
00:27:36,030 --> 00:27:40,050
were never just for assassination.

559
00:27:40,120 --> 00:27:41,860
Great minds think alike.

560
00:27:43,270 --> 00:27:45,490
Keeping him was indeed a threat.

561
00:27:45,950 --> 00:27:46,810
So,

562
00:27:47,390 --> 00:27:49,780
I decided to strike first

563
00:27:50,360 --> 00:27:51,490
and eliminated him.

564
00:28:09,270 --> 00:28:10,900
Why so quiet?

565
00:28:22,200 --> 00:28:23,900
Petty tricks.

566
00:28:30,880 --> 00:28:32,610
Voidcity agreed to go to Blood Sea

567
00:28:32,710 --> 00:28:33,780
and save your clan.

568
00:28:36,680 --> 00:28:38,220
I was defeated by Changgeng.

569
00:28:39,590 --> 00:28:40,450
Originally,

570
00:28:41,320 --> 00:28:43,610
for what you did to Ascendance Sect,

571
00:28:43,630 --> 00:28:45,050
I shouldn't let you off.

572
00:28:45,320 --> 00:28:47,100
But the Grand Mage of Voidcity told me

573
00:28:47,320 --> 00:28:49,850
your clan is controlled by Westdawn,

574
00:28:49,950 --> 00:28:51,380
so you had no choice.

575
00:28:51,830 --> 00:28:54,850
Do you want to be their pawn forever,

576
00:28:55,400 --> 00:28:56,900
or borrow my strength

577
00:28:57,830 --> 00:28:59,330
to save your people?

578
00:29:03,200 --> 00:29:04,930
You picked a fine outfit.

579
00:29:05,110 --> 00:29:05,780
Today

580
00:29:06,400 --> 00:29:08,420
is indeed a good day.

581
00:29:08,560 --> 00:29:09,330
You...

582
00:29:20,110 --> 00:29:22,300
Your Majesty, this move...

583
00:29:22,560 --> 00:29:23,780
It's a dead end.

584
00:29:26,400 --> 00:29:29,260
Brilliant.

585
00:29:29,710 --> 00:29:31,780
Using their own spear
against their shield.

586
00:29:32,590 --> 00:29:33,380
It seems

587
00:29:33,830 --> 00:29:37,180
you hid quite a few good moves.

588
00:29:37,830 --> 00:29:39,020
That's flattering.

589
00:29:39,040 --> 00:29:40,850
Pity you didn't anticipate.

590
00:29:40,920 --> 00:29:41,900
Hiding your moves?

591
00:29:42,320 --> 00:29:45,500
You're good at it, and so am I.

592
00:29:46,870 --> 00:29:49,850
After the Deity-Demon War,
the Dragon Clan split into the four.

593
00:29:50,040 --> 00:29:51,380
Besides me,
the Dragon King of the East Sea,

594
00:29:51,440 --> 00:29:53,570
there are the Northern, Southern,
and Western Seas.

595
00:29:53,710 --> 00:29:55,610
[North Sea Rebels]
They're all hoping

596
00:29:55,610 --> 00:29:56,690
[South Sea Rebels]
I'll step down soon.

597
00:29:56,710 --> 00:29:58,580
Then they'll rebel

598
00:29:58,580 --> 00:30:00,050
[West Sea Rebels]
and march on the East Sea.

599
00:30:00,520 --> 00:30:03,730
I told you, this is the East Sea.

600
00:30:03,750 --> 00:30:05,690
I have the first-move advantage.

601
00:30:05,710 --> 00:30:06,780
Your Majesty.

602
00:30:07,400 --> 00:30:09,380
To keep the Dragon Clan
from pledging to Celestial Court,

603
00:30:09,710 --> 00:30:11,450
you'd rather spark a Four Seas War?

604
00:30:11,470 --> 00:30:13,210
Ao Yi is still young.

605
00:30:13,230 --> 00:30:14,380
He has long seemed unfit.

606
00:30:14,400 --> 00:30:16,780
If he inherits East Sea's line,

607
00:30:16,920 --> 00:30:19,810
the Three Seas won't bow to him.

608
00:30:19,870 --> 00:30:21,810
With a slight push from me,

609
00:30:21,870 --> 00:30:23,730
war will engulf the Four Seas.

610
00:30:23,870 --> 00:30:25,970
Then the Dragon Clan
will be too busy surviving.

611
00:30:25,990 --> 00:30:27,810
How could they pledge?

612
00:30:27,990 --> 00:30:29,300
Don't you fear

613
00:30:29,640 --> 00:30:31,810
this war will ruin the Dragon Clan?

614
00:30:33,280 --> 00:30:35,210
The Dragon Kings of the Three Sea

615
00:30:35,230 --> 00:30:36,730
are no match for me.

616
00:30:36,750 --> 00:30:38,020
Whenever I want,

617
00:30:38,040 --> 00:30:39,970
I can reclaim the Three Seas.

618
00:30:40,710 --> 00:30:42,970
Can Ao Yi do the same?

619
00:30:43,640 --> 00:30:45,140
If he fights,

620
00:30:45,350 --> 00:30:47,500
the wedding can't happen.

621
00:30:47,640 --> 00:30:49,500
If he doesn't,

622
00:30:49,640 --> 00:30:52,020
someone must quell rebels for him.

623
00:30:53,110 --> 00:30:54,900
Inside the Dragon Palace,

624
00:30:55,110 --> 00:30:57,500
only two people have such power.

625
00:30:57,520 --> 00:30:58,570
Besides me,

626
00:30:58,750 --> 00:31:00,730
it's Fairy Yunxiao.

627
00:31:02,230 --> 00:31:05,450
If she goes to quell the armies,

628
00:31:05,470 --> 00:31:07,300
you have no protection.

629
00:31:07,640 --> 00:31:09,730
I can kill you anytime.

630
00:31:10,110 --> 00:31:11,690
You can't make a move.

631
00:31:12,470 --> 00:31:13,810
You've lost

632
00:31:14,280 --> 00:31:15,730
this game.

633
00:31:17,710 --> 00:31:19,260
Why do you laugh?

634
00:31:20,990 --> 00:31:21,900
Your Majesty.

635
00:31:23,070 --> 00:31:26,050
You know him too little.

636
00:31:26,590 --> 00:31:28,050
What do you mean?

637
00:31:28,070 --> 00:31:29,450
By his calculations,

638
00:31:29,590 --> 00:31:31,450
unless his odds are near certain,

639
00:31:31,710 --> 00:31:32,970
he will not make a move.

640
00:31:33,110 --> 00:31:33,810
So,

641
00:31:33,830 --> 00:31:36,090
when you sat down to play,

642
00:31:36,320 --> 00:31:37,540
you should have admitted defeat.

643
00:31:42,800 --> 00:31:43,780
I did it again.

644
00:31:50,680 --> 00:31:51,260
Who's that guy?

645
00:31:51,280 --> 00:31:51,850
Why's he lying here?

646
00:31:51,870 --> 00:31:52,420
No idea.

647
00:31:52,800 --> 00:31:53,540
He's in our way.

648
00:31:53,540 --> 00:31:55,470
♪I don't ask, too lazy to fight♪

649
00:31:55,680 --> 00:31:57,320
♪I dare to live my own way♪

650
00:31:57,320 --> 00:31:58,090
Here you are.

651
00:31:59,470 --> 00:32:00,540
Got tired of waiting.

652
00:32:02,080 --> 00:32:03,750
♪The stars smile at fireflies♪

653
00:32:03,750 --> 00:32:04,690
One man

654
00:32:04,870 --> 00:32:06,730
to stop the rebel army?

655
00:32:06,750 --> 00:32:08,930
Don't look down on the Dragon Clan.

656
00:32:08,950 --> 00:32:10,850
Even if Zhao Gongming's power is great,

657
00:32:10,920 --> 00:32:13,420
he can't quell three armies in one day.

658
00:32:13,920 --> 00:32:14,810
Once fighting starts,

659
00:32:15,040 --> 00:32:17,900
it'll be a war between the Seizing Sect
and the Dragon Clan.

660
00:32:17,920 --> 00:32:18,850
Aren't you afraid...

661
00:32:20,520 --> 00:32:22,090
Why do you laugh again?

662
00:32:22,090 --> 00:32:23,760
♪Let the answer be empty♪

663
00:32:23,830 --> 00:32:25,620
Who says he came to fight?

664
00:32:26,800 --> 00:32:27,930
What are you doing?

665
00:32:28,360 --> 00:32:30,500
♪I drink the breeze that comes my way♪

666
00:32:30,500 --> 00:32:32,340
♪The steadiest surge of all♪

667
00:32:32,730 --> 00:32:35,010
♪I grasp the vast firmament♪

668
00:32:35,200 --> 00:32:37,300
I am Grandlord of Ascendance Sect.

669
00:32:37,560 --> 00:32:38,850
How dare you

670
00:32:39,590 --> 00:32:40,900
wound me so badly?

671
00:32:42,070 --> 00:32:42,850
You guys...

672
00:32:43,200 --> 00:32:45,330
How dare you ambush me?

673
00:32:45,400 --> 00:32:46,260
The Elucidating Sect

674
00:32:46,280 --> 00:32:48,420
has Twelve Aureate Immortals.

675
00:32:48,560 --> 00:32:49,780
North Sea Dragon Clan, right?

676
00:32:50,200 --> 00:32:52,300
You gang up on a Seizing Sect disciple.

677
00:32:52,320 --> 00:32:53,450
I'll inform my Saint

678
00:32:53,470 --> 00:32:54,930
to see how to handle this.

679
00:32:55,350 --> 00:32:56,500
I'll inform

680
00:32:57,470 --> 00:32:59,260
Human Sect's Grandlord.

681
00:32:59,830 --> 00:33:02,020
Your South Sea Dragon Clan

682
00:33:03,350 --> 00:33:04,730
will pay blood for blood.

683
00:33:05,040 --> 00:33:06,690
They'll surely avenge me!

684
00:33:07,180 --> 00:33:09,220
♪In this Primordial World♪

685
00:33:09,220 --> 00:33:10,710
♪Who's out there sword riding♪

686
00:33:10,710 --> 00:33:12,260
Quit scamming people here.

687
00:33:12,440 --> 00:33:13,050
Get lost.

688
00:33:14,030 --> 00:33:16,150
♪Snarling and grinning,
playing lone hero♪

689
00:33:16,150 --> 00:33:18,400
♪I toss aside my cup;
my hands open wide♪

690
00:33:18,470 --> 00:33:19,260
What's this?

691
00:33:19,350 --> 00:33:20,260
A magic instrument.

692
00:33:20,320 --> 00:33:21,090
Image Recorder.

693
00:33:21,520 --> 00:33:22,210
What's it for?

694
00:33:22,800 --> 00:33:24,020
Recording proof of you stabbing me.

695
00:33:26,350 --> 00:33:27,300
He's down!

696
00:33:27,320 --> 00:33:28,090
Run. Hurry, run.

697
00:33:28,520 --> 00:33:29,090
Go.

698
00:33:29,640 --> 00:33:30,140
Fast.

699
00:33:31,200 --> 00:33:32,570
Blood for blood.

700
00:33:32,590 --> 00:33:33,620
Go, go, go.

701
00:33:33,950 --> 00:33:35,930
Blood for blood.

702
00:33:36,400 --> 00:33:37,210
Go, go, go.

703
00:33:37,230 --> 00:33:38,260
Such strong sword aura.

704
00:33:38,920 --> 00:33:40,500
It didn't touch me, yet I'm hurt.

705
00:33:40,500 --> 00:33:41,940
♪The steadiest surge of all♪

706
00:33:42,530 --> 00:33:44,740
♪I grasp the vast firmament♪

707
00:33:45,280 --> 00:33:47,380
Who exactly are you?

708
00:33:47,750 --> 00:33:49,730
From Celestial Court to Three Sects,

709
00:33:49,920 --> 00:33:52,090
all obeying your commands alone.

710
00:33:53,400 --> 00:33:55,180
I'm just an Ascendance Sect's

711
00:33:55,350 --> 00:33:57,260
human disciple,

712
00:33:57,400 --> 00:33:58,330
named Li Changshou.

713
00:34:01,830 --> 00:34:03,210
Even so,

714
00:34:03,640 --> 00:34:06,210
you only fought me to a draw.

715
00:34:06,400 --> 00:34:07,810
As long as I

716
00:34:07,830 --> 00:34:09,300
stay here and don't go out,

717
00:34:09,320 --> 00:34:10,690
with no parents present,

718
00:34:10,710 --> 00:34:12,380
his wedding won't happen.

719
00:34:13,470 --> 00:34:16,020
Dragon King, talking to the brat,

720
00:34:16,200 --> 00:34:17,780
I suggest you think twice.

721
00:34:17,800 --> 00:34:19,330
I thought very carefully.

722
00:34:19,920 --> 00:34:21,140
Up until now,

723
00:34:21,350 --> 00:34:23,660
you've only countered my moves.

724
00:34:23,680 --> 00:34:26,140
Even if you block every piece,

725
00:34:26,160 --> 00:34:27,970
you still cannot threaten me.

726
00:34:28,950 --> 00:34:29,540
What?

727
00:34:29,990 --> 00:34:31,330
Have you not seen it?

728
00:34:33,040 --> 00:34:34,900
Look closer at this board.

729
00:34:39,460 --> 00:34:44,180
[Steady]

730
00:35:04,110 --> 00:35:05,180
When did you

731
00:35:05,640 --> 00:35:08,330
deploy such a giant army outside?

732
00:35:10,920 --> 00:35:12,140
I'm asking you to let her go.

733
00:35:12,520 --> 00:35:13,090
Okay.

734
00:35:14,400 --> 00:35:15,730
I will.

735
00:35:16,160 --> 00:35:17,380
But I have one condition.

736
00:35:17,680 --> 00:35:18,500
I want to learn

737
00:35:18,870 --> 00:35:20,210
Beans into Soldiers.

738
00:35:21,110 --> 00:35:24,930
East Sea is so great.
We love the East Sea.

739
00:35:25,160 --> 00:35:25,780
Brothers.

740
00:35:26,640 --> 00:35:27,730
The Sea Deity has given an order.

741
00:35:27,750 --> 00:35:29,450
Within three days,

742
00:35:29,470 --> 00:35:31,420
we must plant all these beans.

743
00:35:31,520 --> 00:35:31,930
Okay.

744
00:35:31,950 --> 00:35:32,970
We gotta work harder.

745
00:35:35,920 --> 00:35:36,570
Okay.

746
00:35:37,670 --> 00:35:40,650
♪In days to come, be God or Demon♪

747
00:35:41,070 --> 00:35:43,110
♪Let them all come♪

748
00:35:43,300 --> 00:35:47,220
♪There's a perfect plan for everything♪

749
00:35:47,870 --> 00:35:49,450
You're a thousand-year-old dragon.

750
00:35:49,590 --> 00:35:51,210
I would never dare be careless.

751
00:35:52,400 --> 00:35:53,500
These 100,000 celestial troops

752
00:35:53,560 --> 00:35:55,300
are merely a small part

753
00:35:55,320 --> 00:35:56,690
of the moves I hide.

754
00:35:56,800 --> 00:35:58,540
If you also have hidden moves,

755
00:35:59,070 --> 00:35:59,970
then I'm willing

756
00:36:00,110 --> 00:36:02,300
to offer them for one glimpse.

757
00:36:03,640 --> 00:36:06,180
Your Majesty, he's not bluffing.

758
00:36:06,470 --> 00:36:08,020
I've clashed with him many times.

759
00:36:08,710 --> 00:36:09,930
Even now, I still do not know

760
00:36:10,520 --> 00:36:12,500
how many cards he truly holds.

761
00:36:13,280 --> 00:36:14,180
Please forgive me.

762
00:36:14,230 --> 00:36:16,090
I'll hide less in the future.

763
00:36:17,620 --> 00:36:19,810
♪Who's clamoring behind♪

764
00:36:20,180 --> 00:36:22,310
♪Acting like fierce demons♪

765
00:36:22,700 --> 00:36:26,400
♪I steadily divine the world's fate♪

766
00:36:26,400 --> 00:36:29,450
I ruled the East Sea for 1,000 years,

767
00:36:30,320 --> 00:36:32,850
never meeting a match.

768
00:36:34,320 --> 00:36:35,260
Today,

769
00:36:36,040 --> 00:36:36,850
I was defeated

770
00:36:36,870 --> 00:36:39,660
by a young disciple of the Human Clan.

771
00:36:40,200 --> 00:36:42,540
With Celestial Court aided by you,

772
00:36:45,350 --> 00:36:46,420
it seems

773
00:36:47,560 --> 00:36:50,140
my Dragon Clan's thousand-year fate

774
00:36:50,400 --> 00:36:52,460
♪Rising with golden armor♪

775
00:36:54,320 --> 00:36:57,090
is about to reach its end.

776
00:37:02,110 --> 00:37:02,900
A good game.

777
00:37:05,560 --> 00:37:07,300
The Westdawn Sect's power is eliminated,

778
00:37:07,800 --> 00:37:09,570
and the Great Tribulation
vanished without trace.

779
00:37:10,350 --> 00:37:12,380
The burden Fate placed upon us

780
00:37:12,800 --> 00:37:14,660
can finally be laid down now.

781
00:37:15,800 --> 00:37:16,570
Yeah.

782
00:37:16,920 --> 00:37:18,780
At last, we've come to this point.

783
00:37:19,920 --> 00:37:21,650
Even Dragon King lost to you.

784
00:37:22,230 --> 00:37:24,090
You're truly something.

785
00:37:24,150 --> 00:37:25,090
Not at all.

786
00:37:25,110 --> 00:37:27,050
It's all thanks to your strong support.

787
00:37:28,280 --> 00:37:30,860
Now you don't think I get in the way?

788
00:37:31,400 --> 00:37:32,260
I wouldn't dare.

789
00:37:32,440 --> 00:37:33,900
If you get angry,

790
00:37:33,960 --> 00:37:36,420
that'll be a Great Tribulation upon me.

791
00:37:37,440 --> 00:37:38,490
So,

792
00:37:39,150 --> 00:37:40,610
I am your Great Tribulation?

793
00:37:45,320 --> 00:37:46,090
Li Changshou.

794
00:37:46,840 --> 00:37:48,300
This Great Tribulation...

795
00:37:50,070 --> 00:37:50,980
Do you like it?

796
00:37:55,000 --> 00:37:56,050
So that's how it is?

797
00:38:01,150 --> 00:38:02,170
So that's how it is.

798
00:38:08,110 --> 00:38:09,740
His Majesty, the Dragon King, arrives.

799
00:38:10,740 --> 00:38:16,020
[Happiness]

800
00:38:23,000 --> 00:38:23,820
Father.

801
00:38:30,320 --> 00:38:31,340
Before meeting you,

802
00:38:32,190 --> 00:38:33,260
I always thought

803
00:38:33,920 --> 00:38:35,130
I had to face

804
00:38:35,710 --> 00:38:37,010
the Great Tribulation alone.

805
00:38:37,880 --> 00:38:39,050
No one would believe me,

806
00:38:39,840 --> 00:38:41,130
and no one would help me.

807
00:38:43,360 --> 00:38:43,940
Yes.

808
00:38:44,880 --> 00:38:45,740
Fate,

809
00:38:46,360 --> 00:38:47,260
Great Tribulation,

810
00:38:47,630 --> 00:38:48,490
and prophecy...

811
00:38:49,230 --> 00:38:50,860
It sounds like a dream.

812
00:38:53,280 --> 00:38:54,090
But luckily,

813
00:38:55,150 --> 00:38:56,090
I met you.

814
00:38:58,630 --> 00:38:59,490
Right back at you.

815
00:39:03,920 --> 00:39:07,340
The new couple beams with joy.

816
00:39:07,360 --> 00:39:09,170
A match made in heaven.

817
00:39:09,190 --> 00:39:11,490
Begin the wedding bows.

818
00:39:13,280 --> 00:39:15,820
First bow to Heaven and Earth.

819
00:39:16,220 --> 00:39:20,450
♪At the cloud peak, with sun and moon♪

820
00:39:20,740 --> 00:39:24,750
♪My heart is carved
with all living beings♪

821
00:39:25,960 --> 00:39:27,170
Before I met you,

822
00:39:27,400 --> 00:39:28,460
I never imagined

823
00:39:28,880 --> 00:39:30,610
a young disciple of the Human Clan

824
00:39:31,070 --> 00:39:32,460
could bring me such peace.

825
00:39:34,480 --> 00:39:36,530
As though all my unrest found peace,

826
00:39:37,070 --> 00:39:39,610
and all my troubles faded away.

827
00:39:40,120 --> 00:39:42,510
♪I recall our near misses♪

828
00:39:42,510 --> 00:39:45,570
Second bow to your parent.

829
00:39:52,360 --> 00:39:54,490
Even if only you and I remained

830
00:39:55,110 --> 00:39:56,010
I would still be willing.

831
00:39:59,030 --> 00:39:59,900
Li Changshou.

832
00:40:01,910 --> 00:40:08,450
♪Making me lean down and confirm slowly♪

833
00:40:10,160 --> 00:40:13,110
♪Not knowing what love truly is♪

834
00:40:13,110 --> 00:40:14,990
♪Just as it was at first♪

835
00:40:15,320 --> 00:40:19,110
♪Day after day, with whom to share♪

836
00:40:19,390 --> 00:40:21,270
♪Never once have I set foot there♪

837
00:40:21,400 --> 00:40:22,380
I'll ask you a question.

838
00:40:23,230 --> 00:40:24,570
Answer me truthfully.

839
00:40:26,190 --> 00:40:26,980
Now,

840
00:40:27,480 --> 00:40:29,420
I helped you break all plights.

841
00:40:30,320 --> 00:40:31,130
From now on,

842
00:40:31,510 --> 00:40:33,210
no one will covet the Pregenesis Sword,

843
00:40:33,920 --> 00:40:35,570
and no one can threaten us.

844
00:40:36,850 --> 00:40:38,230
♪At storm's end♪

845
00:40:38,230 --> 00:40:39,300
I say,

846
00:40:39,300 --> 00:40:40,800
♪stars gleam, and clouds drift♪

847
00:40:40,800 --> 00:40:42,090
I want to stay with you,

848
00:40:42,920 --> 00:40:44,300
be by your side from now on.

849
00:40:53,280 --> 00:40:54,260
Would you?

850
00:41:32,210 --> 00:41:37,990
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

851
00:41:38,660 --> 00:41:45,360
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

852
00:41:46,890 --> 00:41:52,940
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

853
00:41:53,570 --> 00:42:00,020
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

854
00:42:00,760 --> 00:42:07,880
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

855
00:42:08,260 --> 00:42:15,160
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

856
00:42:15,540 --> 00:42:22,890
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

857
00:42:22,890 --> 00:42:30,060
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

858
00:42:46,200 --> 00:42:51,370
♪Down a few more cups of wine♪

859
00:42:52,460 --> 00:42:59,480
♪Through land and sea,
I ask you to come♪

860
00:43:00,670 --> 00:43:06,610
♪For honor's sake, upright and grand♪

861
00:43:07,310 --> 00:43:14,390
♪Alas, our story is short♪

862
00:43:14,730 --> 00:43:21,840
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

863
00:43:22,160 --> 00:43:28,640
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

864
00:43:29,420 --> 00:43:36,630
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

865
00:43:37,020 --> 00:43:44,840
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪
